444
00:34:47.752 --> 00:34:50.088
Kahit na nagising ka pagkatapos ng aksidente...

445
00:34:56.094 --> 00:34:56.928
Kahit noon pa…

446
00:34:59.847 --> 00:35:01.349
hindi ka nagulat

447
